{
  "id": "wow_tv_universal",
  "title": "Sistema Panasonic (Wow TV)",
  "parent": "inst_smarttv",
  "description": "Tutorial de instalação via DNS para Smart TVs Panasonic com sistema My Home Screen.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-amber-600/10 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-amber-500 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Sistema Panasonic</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>A Panasonic possui uma loja de apps mais restrita. O melhor método de instalação é via DNS.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4'>Configurar o DNS</h4><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Acesse as configurações de rede da sua TV e altere o DNS Primário para:</p><div class='bg-black/40 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-gray-700 text-center'><p class='text-lg font-black text-blue-400 tracking-tighter'>45.139.122.240</p></div></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4'>Abrir o Aplicativo</h4><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed'>Após configurar o DNS, procure na loja de aplicativos da Panasonic pelo app <b>WoW TV</b>. Ao abrir, ele iniciará automaticamente o nosso serviço TOPTV.</p></div></section></div>"
  }
}
